{"discussions":[{"id":"8837a7e0-a533-11f1-8080-80012561f926","post":{"id":"8837a7e0-a533-11f1-8080-80012561f926","owner":{"id":"15427078","username":"CloudComputing","firstName":"Cloud Tech","lastName":"Stocks","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/15138209/3.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/15138209/3.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/15138209/3.jpg"},"roles":["eTorian","CopyPortfolio","Verified","Regular","Depositor"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":218,"piLevel":0},"obsoleteId":"bef050b5-228f-4446-b2e3-3de261f5c41e","created":"2026-08-31T12:00:17.246Z","message":{"text":"☁️ AI Is Creating a New Generation of Cloud Infrastructure\n\n👉 The cloud market is evolving again. Alongside traditional hyperscalers, a new category of AI-first providers known as “neoclouds” is emerging to meet the enormous computing requirements of modern AI workloads. \n\n👉 Unlike traditional cloud platforms built largely around general-purpose computing, neoclouds are optimized for GPU-intensive workloads that demand high processing power, low latency and enormous bandwidth. \n\n👉 The opportunity could become substantial. ABI Research estimates the neocloud market could grow to around $250 billion by 2030 as demand for AI compute continues to expand. \n\n👉 That trend is particularly relevant to the @CloudComputing Smart Portfolio. $NBIS, one of its largest holdings, represents this emerging AI-first cloud model, while $MSFT and $GOOGL remain major hyperscale platforms investing heavily to serve the same accelerating demand for AI infrastructure.\n\n👉 The opportunity also extends across the broader cloud ecosystem. As more AI workloads move into the cloud, platforms supporting data, observability, security and application infrastructure — including portfolio holdings such as $SNOW, $DDOG, $PANW and $CRWD — could become increasingly important to making that infrastructure usable and secure.\n\n👉 Neoclouds are not necessarily replacing hyperscalers. Instead, they are adding another layer to the cloud economy by expanding access to specialized compute and creating more choice for enterprises, AI developers and governments. \n\n💡 One interesting takeaway:\n\nAI may be expanding the cloud opportunity rather than simply shifting market share between existing providers.\n\nTraditional hyperscalers offer enormous scale, while neoclouds specialize in scarce AI compute. Around both sits an ecosystem of software, data and cybersecurity companies needed to operate that infrastructure.\n\nThat makes the next phase of cloud growth potentially broader than the hyperscalers alone.\n\n✨ The @CloudComputing Smart Portfolio provides diversified exposure across the cloud ecosystem, from hyperscale and AI-first infrastructure to the software, data and cybersecurity platforms built on top of it.\n\n🔗 Read more: https://www.weforum.org/stories/artificial-intelligence/what-are-neoclouds-reshape-architecture-economics-ai/\n\nPast performance is not an indication of future results.\n","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-08-31T12:00:17.246Z","isDeleted":false,"type":"Default","metadata":{},"attachments":[{"url":"https://openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/rich-media/images/cloudcomputing/1e517453-c227-4e55-b6f6-ed9344f648eb-2026-08-31.png","host":"openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com","mediaType":"Image","media":{"image":{"width":1200,"height":628,"url":"https://openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/rich-media/images/cloudcomputing/1e517453-c227-4e55-b6f6-ed9344f648eb-2026-08-31.png"},"video":{"videoSource":"None","image":{"width":0,"height":0}}}}],"tags":[{"market":{"id":"1053","symbolName":"NBIS","displayName":"Nebius Group NV","updated":"2026-09-01T07:44:49.166Z","assetType":"Stocks","internalId":1053,"avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/yndx/50x50.png","medium":"/medium/YNDX.png","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/yndx/150x150.png","svg":{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/1053/1053_052B42_FFFFFF.svg","backgroundColor":"#052B42","textColor":"#FFFFFF"}},"application":"eToro","metadata":"","assetTypeId":5,"assetTypeSubCategoryId":0}},{"market":{"id":"1004","symbolName":"MSFT","displayName":"Microsoft","updated":"2026-09-01T08:15:55.382Z","assetType":"Stocks","internalId":1004,"avatar":{"small":"/medium/Microsoft.png","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/msft/90x90.png","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/msft/150x150.png","svg":{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/1004/1004_F7F7F7_2C2C2C.svg","backgroundColor":"#F7F7F7","textColor":"#2C2C2C"}},"application":"eToro","metadata":"","assetTypeId":5,"assetTypeSubCategoryId":0}},{"market":{"id":"6434","symbolName":"GOOGL","displayName":"Alphabet Inc Class A","updated":"2026-09-01T07:44:49.171Z","assetType":"Stocks","internalId":6434,"avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/6434/35x35.png","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/6434/50x50.png","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/6434/150x150.png","svg":{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/6434/6434_ED1C24_F7F7F7.svg","backgroundColor":"#ED1C24","textColor":"#F7F7F7"}},"application":"eToro","metadata":"","assetTypeId":5,"assetTypeSubCategoryId":0}},{"market":{"id":"7999","symbolName":"SNOW","displayName":"Snowflake Inc.","updated":"2026-09-01T09:18:09.066Z","assetType":"Stocks","internalId":7999,"avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/7999/35x35.png","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/7999/50x50.png","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/7999/150x150.png","svg":{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/7999/7999_0FA4E5_F7F7F7.svg","backgroundColor":"#0FA4E5","textColor":"#F7F7F7"}},"application":"eToro","metadata":"","assetTypeId":5,"assetTypeSubCategoryId":0}},{"market":{"id":"6414","symbolName":"DDOG","displayName":"Datadog Inc","updated":"2026-09-01T09:49:15.937Z","assetType":"Stocks","internalId":6414,"avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/6414/35x35.png","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/6414/50x50.png","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/6414/150x150.png","svg":{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/6414/6414_622CA5_F7F7F7.svg","backgroundColor":"#622CA5","textColor":"#F7F7F7"}},"application":"eToro","metadata":"","assetTypeId":5,"assetTypeSubCategoryId":0}},{"market":{"id":"4124","symbolName":"PANW","displayName":"Palo Alto Networks","updated":"2026-09-01T08:15:55.369Z","assetType":"Stocks","internalId":4124,"avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/panw/80x80.png","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/panw/90x90.png","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/panw/150x150.png","svg":{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/4124/4124_326988_F7F7F7.svg","backgroundColor":"#326988","textColor":"#F7F7F7"}},"application":"eToro","metadata":"","assetTypeId":5,"assetTypeSubCategoryId":0}},{"market":{"id":"5506","symbolName":"CRWD","displayName":"Crowdstrike Holdings","updated":"2026-09-01T08:15:55.379Z","assetType":"Stocks","internalId":5506,"avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/5506/35x35.png","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/5506/50x50.png","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/5506/150x150.png","svg":{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/5506/5506_FC0000_F7F7F7.svg","backgroundColor":"#FC0000","textColor":"#F7F7F7"}},"application":"eToro","metadata":"","assetTypeId":5,"assetTypeSubCategoryId":0}}],"mentions":[{"user":{"id":"15427078","username":"CloudComputing","firstName":"Cloud Tech","lastName":"Stocks","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/15138209/3.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/15138209/3.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/15138209/3.jpg"},"roles":["eTorian","CopyPortfolio","Verified","Regular","Depositor"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":218,"piLevel":0},"isDirect":false}],"isSpam":false,"editStatus":"None"},"commentsData":{"reactionPaging":{"totalCount":2},"comments":[{"entity":{"message":{"text":"excellent post. I agree that neocloud providers could become an increasingly important part of the AI infrastructure ecosystem. The distinction between general-purpose cloud computing and infrastructure designed specifically for intensive GPU workloads is particularly useful","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-08-31T19:09:03.699Z","isSpam":false,"editStatus":"Edited","id":"911cfc5c-c4c3-45d2-ba51-86d2756dee37","owner":{"id":"45835309","username":"jazzjohal00","firstName":"Jaswinder","lastName":"Johal","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/45749889/2.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/45749889/2.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/45749889/2.jpg"},"roles":["PI","Verified","Regular","Depositor"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":218,"piLevel":4},"obsoleteId":"911cfc5c-c4c3-45d2-ba51-86d2756dee37","parent":{"id":"8837a7e0-a533-11f1-8080-80012561f926","obsoleteId":"8837a7e0-a533-11f1-8080-80012561f926","type":"Post"},"created":"2026-08-31T12:56:28.701Z"},"repliesCount":0,"emotionsData":{"like":{"paging":{"totalCount":0}}},"requesterContext":{"isFlaggingAsSpam":false,"isSubscribed":false,"isLiking":false,"isSaved":false,"isPinned":false,"isRequesterBlocking":false,"isInteractionRestricted":false,"isFollowing":false,"isOwner":false},"replies":[]},{"entity":{"message":{"text":"The useful point is that AI may be widening the cloud market instead of just moving share from one group to another. Hyperscalers still have the scale. The newer names are trying to sell scarce GPU capacity that the old model was not built around.\n\nNebius sitting next to Microsoft and Alphabet in the same theme makes that mix clearer. One is the specialized layer, the others are the platforms trying not to lose the same demand.\n\nThe software names around it matter just as much. If the compute gets built and then needs to be observed, secured and turned into usable data, the opportunity is wider than the infrastructure stocks alone.\n\nDo you treat the neocloud names as a separate sleeve with a tighter size limit, or as part of the same cloud allocation as the hyperscalers?\n\n———————————————  \nAndrei Langaschek  \nCadet Popular Investor | eToro","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-08-31T19:08:51.73Z","isSpam":false,"editStatus":"Edited","id":"e3b54da2-8580-427c-bb34-9a295f58dfe7","owner":{"id":"26169616","username":"ANDREIWARRINGTON","firstName":"Andrei","lastName":"Langaschek","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/25886892/1.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/25886892/1.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/25886892/1.jpg"},"roles":["PI","Verified","Regular"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":218,"piLevel":2},"obsoleteId":"e3b54da2-8580-427c-bb34-9a295f58dfe7","parent":{"id":"8837a7e0-a533-11f1-8080-80012561f926","obsoleteId":"8837a7e0-a533-11f1-8080-80012561f926","type":"Post"},"created":"2026-08-31T12:05:44.236Z"},"repliesCount":0,"emotionsData":{"like":{"paging":{"totalCount":0}}},"requesterContext":{"isFlaggingAsSpam":false,"isSubscribed":false,"isLiking":false,"isSaved":false,"isPinned":false,"isRequesterBlocking":false,"isInteractionRestricted":false,"isFollowing":false,"isOwner":false},"replies":[]}]},"emotionsData":{"like":{"paging":{"totalCount":12},"emotions":[{"type":"Like","id":"like_8837a7e0-a533-11f1-8080-80012561f926_36084300